{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0175Es6WAxBcqU2NXcQEztKv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have all the context needed. Let me construct the detailed worst-tier predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  bf16 的低尾数精度（7-bit vs fp16 的 10-bit）大幅降低 importance score 的判别力，\n  使 importance eviction 在 bf16 下部分退化为 noisy pseudo-random。这压缩了 severity gradient 至 fp32 的 20-50%，\n  并在 s015 级别导致 CI 跨零。Qwen 未展现 monotonic phase-dependent gradient，C5 判定 not_confirmed。\n  论文需 reframe 为 methodology contribution：phase-stratified evaluation framework 暴露了 compound sparsity \n  对 eviction strategy 和 numerical precision 的隐藏敏感性。核心叙事从 \"emergent interaction\" 转为 \n  \"compound sparsity benchmarking reveals hidden sensitivity\"。贡献重构为三点：\n  (1) phase-stratified evaluation framework，(2) DeepSeek 上的 empirical phase sensitivity 发现，\n  (3) entropy-discrimination collapse 作为 testable hypothesis。\n  这类 'evaluation methodology matters' 论文在 EMNLP 有先例，不降级 venue 但需大幅改写 intro。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ================================================================\n  # plan_001: DeepSeek importance bf16 × 4 sparsity\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"DeepSeek importance bf16 × 4 sparsity\"\n    plan_id: plan_001\n    description: >\n      bf16 重跑 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B importance masking 在 s=0.15/0.20/0.25/0.30 四个 sparsity 级别。\n      消除 fp16 NaN 偏差，获得干净基线数据。\n    expected_results:\n      bf16_importance_s015:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.23\n        ii_mid_mean: 0.55\n        ii_low_mean: 2.42\n        ii_high_median: 0.17\n        ii_mid_median: 0.38\n        ii_low_median: 1.15\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 3.8\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [-0.8, 9.5]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.042\n        problems: 50\n      bf16_importance_s020:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.41\n        ii_mid_mean: 1.72\n        ii_low_mean: 8.65\n        ii_high_median: 0.30\n        ii_mid_median: 1.05\n        ii_low_median: 4.20\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 5.4\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [1.1, 12.8]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.008\n        problems: 50\n      bf16_importance_s025:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.69\n        ii_mid_mean: 3.25\n        ii_low_mean: 20.8\n        ii_high_median: 0.52\n        ii_mid_median: 2.10\n        ii_low_median: 9.80\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 12.2\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [3.5, 28.0]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.0002\n        problems: 50\n      bf16_importance_s030:\n        ii_high_mean: 1.05\n        ii_mid_mean: 8.9\n        ii_low_mean: 135.0\n        ii_high_median: 0.72\n        ii_mid_median: 4.50\n        ii_low_median: 18.5\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 17.8\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [5.8, 48.0]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.0000\n        problems: 50\n      bf16_fp32_ratios:\n        s015: 0.33\n        s020: 0.49\n        s025: 0.34\n        s030: 0.42\n      gradient_range_across_sparsity: [3.8, 17.8]\n      monotonicity_within_phase: \"preserved at s020/s025/s030; s015 borderline (ii_low CI overlaps ii_mid)\"\n      monotonicity_cross_sparsity: \"gradient increases 3.8→5.4→12.2→17.8 but growth rates non-monotonic\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      bf16 的 7-bit 尾数精度（vs fp16 的 10-bit）引入 ~0.78% 相对量化误差到 attention weight 计算中。\n      Importance score 依赖 attention weight 的精细排序来区分 \"重要\" 和 \"不重要\" 的 KV cache entry。\n      bf16 精度损失使 importance score 分布变得更平坦——即使未被 prune 的 head 上，score 的判别力已下降。\n      这等效于在 head pruning 之前就部分触发了 discrimination collapse，\n      使 importance eviction 在所有 phase 都偏向更随机的行为。\n      效果在 low-sparsity phase（attention 本就分散）最显著：原本依赖精细判别的 importance 策略\n      在 bf16 下无法充分区分 token importance，ii_low 被压缩最严重（fp32 的 8.52→bf16 的 2.42 at s015）。\n      s015 级别效应最小，bf16 噪声足以使 bootstrap CI 跨零（p=0.042，勉强显著）。\n      高 sparsity 级别（s025/s030）效应依然显著但幅度大幅衰减——gradient 从 fp32 的 35-42 降至 12-18，\n      衰减比 0.34-0.42。这不是 NaN 导致的 artifact，而是精度本身影响了 importance eviction 的有效性。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: DeepSeek bf16 Importance — Interaction Index by Phase and Sparsity\"\n        columns: [sparsity, ii_high, ii_mid, ii_low, gradient, \"CI_low\", \"CI_high\", p, \"bf16/fp32 ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.15, 0.23, 0.55, 2.42, 3.8, -0.8, 9.5, 0.042, 0.33]\n          - [0.20, 0.41, 1.72, 8.65, 5.4, 1.1, 12.8, 0.008, 0.49]\n          - [0.25, 0.69, 3.25, 20.8, 12.2, 3.5, 28.0, 0.0002, 0.34]\n          - [0.30, 1.05, 8.9, 135.0, 17.8, 5.8, 48.0, 0.0000, 0.42]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: 4×3 grid (sparsity × phase), color = ii_mean。与 fp32 版本并排对比，色标统一。bf16 色彩明显更淡，尤其 low-phase 行被压缩。s015 low-phase 格标注 'n.s.' (CI crosses zero)。\"\n      - \"Line plot: gradient vs sparsity for bf16 vs fp32。两条线，fp32 线陡峭（11→42），bf16 线平缓（3.8→17.8）。灰色带标注 bf16/fp32 ratio 范围 [0.33, 0.49]。\"\n    analysis: >\n      bf16 结果确认 importance eviction 的 phase sensitivity 在方向上仍然存在（high < mid < low ordering 在 s020+ 成立），\n      但幅度被压缩至 fp32 的 33-49%。s015 CI 跨零意味着最低 sparsity 级别的 phase effect 在 bf16 下不再统计显著。\n      这对论文有双重含义：(1) 削弱了 effect size 的 claim（不能说 \"12-75×\"，bf16 下是 \"3.8-17.8×\"）；\n      (2) 但同时提供了新贡献角度——numerical precision 本身是 compound sparsity severity 的隐藏调节因子，\n      这强化了 \"evaluation methodology matters\" 的叙事。论文需报告 fp32 和 bf16 双版本数据，\n      将 precision sensitivity 作为第二个发现维度（strategy × phase × precision 三维交互）。\n      s015 的不显著结果需要在 limitation 中明确讨论。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # plan_002: DeepSeek random bf16 × 4 sparsity\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"DeepSeek random bf16 × 4 sparsity\"\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: >\n      bf16 重跑 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B random masking 在 s=0.15/0.20/0.25/0.30，\n      作为 importance 的配对对照。验证 random eviction 在 bf16 下仍然 phase-invariant。\n    expected_results:\n      bf16_random_s015:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.42\n        ii_mid_mean: 0.48\n        ii_low_mean: 0.45\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 1.05\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [-0.3, 2.8]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.38\n        problems: 50\n      bf16_random_s020:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.80\n        ii_mid_mean: 1.15\n        ii_low_mean: 0.92\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 1.18\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [-0.5, 3.2]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.28\n        problems: 50\n      bf16_random_s025:\n        ii_high_mean: 3.50\n        ii_mid_mean: 3.80\n        ii_low_mean: 3.15\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 0.95\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [-1.2, 3.5]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.42\n        problems: 50\n      bf16_random_s030:\n        ii_high_mean: 19.5\n        ii_mid_mean: 13.2\n        ii_low_mean: 12.8\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 0.72\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [-5.0, 8.5]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.55\n        problems: 50\n      gradient_range_across_sparsity: [0.72, 1.18]\n      phase_flatness: \"all gradients ≈1.0, no significant phase dependence\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Random eviction 不依赖 attention weight 的精度——它随机选择 token 进行 evict，\n      因此 bf16 的精度损失不影响 eviction 决策。compound interaction（head pruning × KV eviction）\n      在 random 策略下的 severity 在所有 phase 保持均匀，因为 random 不受 attention distribution \n      变化的影响。无论 attention 是集中还是分散（high vs low sparsity phase），\n      random 都以相同概率 evict 任意 token，产出一致的 compound degradation。\n      bf16 精度仅影响 perplexity 计算本身的微小数值差异，不改变 random eviction 的 phase-invariant 特性。\n      gradient 维持在 0.7-1.2 范围内，所有 p-value 远不显著，确认 phase flatness。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: DeepSeek bf16 Random — Interaction Index by Phase and Sparsity\"\n        columns: [sparsity, ii_high, ii_mid, ii_low, gradient, p]\n        rows:\n          - [0.15, 0.42, 0.48, 0.45, 1.05, 0.38]\n          - [0.20, 0.80, 1.15, 0.92, 1.18, 0.28]\n          - [0.25, 3.50, 3.80, 3.15, 0.95, 0.42]\n          - [0.30, 19.5, 13.2, 12.8, 0.72, 0.55]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: ii_mean by phase (high/mid/low) for each sparsity level，四条近乎水平的线。与 importance 的陡峭上升形成鲜明对比。即使在 worst tier，importance-random 的定性区别仍然清晰。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Random bf16 结果与 fp32 高度一致（gradient 变化 <0.2），确认 random eviction 的 phase-invariant \n      特性不受 numerical precision 影响。这是 worst tier 中的亮点——C1（strategy-dependence）仍然成立：\n      即使 bf16 压缩了 importance 的 gradient 到 3.8-17.8，random 的 gradient 稳定在 ~1.0。\n      Strategy-dependence 的定性结论（importance >> random in severity gradient）在 bf16 下保持，\n      只是量化幅度减小。这支持 reframe 后的贡献 (2)：precision sensitivity 本身是有意义的发现。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # plan_003: Crossover analysis\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"Crossover analysis from bf16 importance + random\"\n    plan_id: plan_003\n    description: >\n      从 plan_001 和 plan_002 的 bf16 数据中提取 per-phase II，验证 phase-strategy crossover \n      是否在 bf16 下仍存在。纯分析任务。\n    expected_results:\n      deepseek_crossover_s025:\n        importance_high_phase: 0.69\n        importance_low_phase: 20.8\n        random_high_phase: 3.50\n        random_low_phase: 3.15\n        crossover_exists: true\n        crossover_gap_high: -2.81  # importance(0.69) - random(3.50)\n        crossover_gap_low: 17.65   # importance(20.8) - random(3.15)\n        crossover_significance_p: 0.003\n      deepseek_crossover_s030:\n        importance_high_phase: 1.05\n        importance_low_phase: 135.0\n        random_high_phase: 19.5\n        random_low_phase: 12.8\n        crossover_exists: true\n        crossover_gap_high: -18.45\n        crossover_gap_low: 122.2\n      deepseek_crossover_s020:\n        importance_high_phase: 0.41\n        importance_low_phase: 8.65\n        random_high_phase: 0.80\n        random_low_phase: 0.92\n        crossover_exists: true\n        crossover_gap_high: -0.39\n        crossover_gap_low: 7.73\n        note: \"crossover exists but high-phase gap very small (0.39), borderline\"\n      deepseek_crossover_s015:\n        importance_high_phase: 0.23\n        importance_low_phase: 2.42\n        random_high_phase: 0.42\n        random_low_phase: 0.45\n        crossover_exists: true\n        crossover_gap_high: -0.19\n        crossover_gap_low: 1.97\n        note: \"both gaps small and importance_low CI crosses zero, crossover not robust\"\n      qwen_crossover_s025:\n        importance_high_phase: 0.48\n        importance_low_phase: 3.20\n        random_high_phase: 2.80\n        random_low_phase: 2.65\n        crossover_exists: \"marginal\"\n        crossover_gap_low: 0.55\n        note: \"importance_low(3.20) barely > random_low(2.65), CI overlaps → not significant\"\n      crossover_confirmed_models: 1\n      crossover_model_list: [\"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\"]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Crossover 要求在 high-sparsity phase 中 importance < random，而在 low-sparsity phase 中 importance > random。\n      DeepSeek bf16 下这一 pattern 在 s025/s030 仍清晰（importance_low 分别为 20.8 和 135.0，远超 random 的 3.15 和 12.8），\n      但在 s015/s020 crossover 的 gap 很小且依赖 CI 不跨零。\n      Qwen 的情况更糟：importance gradient 仅 1-5×，使得 importance_low 在最高 sparsity（s025）也只有 3.20，\n      勉强超过 random 的 2.65。Bootstrap CI 宽泛到包含零差——crossover 在 Qwen 上不成立。\n      因此 crossover 仅在 DeepSeek 单模型确认（crossover_confirmed_models=1），\n      reviewer 可合理质疑这是 model-specific artifact（DeepSeek-R1 的蒸馏训练方式可能导致特殊的 attention pattern）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Phase-Strategy Crossover Summary (bf16)\"\n        columns: [model, sparsity, \"imp_high\", \"imp_low\", \"rand_high\", \"rand_low\", \"crossover?\", \"gap_significance\"]\n        rows:\n          - [DeepSeek, 0.25, 0.69, 20.8, 3.50, 3.15, \"Yes\", \"p=0.003\"]\n          - [DeepSeek, 0.30, 1.05, 135.0, 19.5, 12.8, \"Yes\", \"p<0.001\"]\n          - [DeepSeek, 0.20, 0.41, 8.65, 0.80, 0.92, \"Yes*\", \"borderline\"]\n          - [DeepSeek, 0.15, 0.23, 2.42, 0.42, 0.45, \"Yes*\", \"n.s. (imp_low CI∋0)\"]\n          - [Qwen, 0.25, 0.48, 3.20, 2.80, 2.65, \"No\", \"gap=0.55, CI∋0\"]\n          - [Qwen, 0.30, 0.65, 5.50, 15.0, 14.2, \"No\", \"imp_low < rand_low\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Crossover diagram: 2×2 panel (DeepSeek × Qwen)。每个 panel 画 importance 和 random 的 high/low phase II 作为 bar pair。DeepSeek panel 显示清晰的 X 形交叉（importance bars 从 low→high 急剧下降，random bars 平坦）。Qwen panel 无交叉——importance bars 微弱上升但始终不超过 random。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Crossover 现象在 bf16 DeepSeek 上依然存在但仅在 s025/s030 robust。s015/s020 的 crossover \n      gap 过小且统计不显著。Qwen 完全未展现 crossover。这意味着 C3 只能声明为 \"observed in \n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B at higher sparsity levels\"，而非 general phenomenon。\n      在 reframed 的 methodology 叙事下，crossover 从 \"核心发现\" 降级为 \"DeepSeek 上的有趣观察\"，\n      作为 phase-stratified evaluation 揭示 hidden sensitivity 的一个案例。\n      Reviewer 将合理质疑 crossover 是 DeepSeek-R1 蒸馏训练导致的特殊 attention pattern 的副产品。\n      应对策略：在 discussion 中明确承认这一限制，并将 crossover 的 model-specificity \n      本身作为 \"compound sparsity 行为比预期更 model-dependent\" 的证据。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # plan_004: Qwen importance bf16 × 4 sparsity\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"Qwen importance bf16 × 4 sparsity\"\n    plan_id: plan_004\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct importance masking bf16 在 s=0.15/0.20/0.25/0.30。\n      Cross-model replication 核心实验。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_importance_s015:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.20\n        ii_mid_mean: 0.35\n        ii_low_mean: 0.22\n        ii_high_median: 0.15\n        ii_mid_median: 0.28\n        ii_low_median: 0.18\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 1.2\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [-0.8, 3.5]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.15\n        problems: 50\n        phase_ordering: \"mid > low > high (NOT monotonic)\"\n      qwen_importance_s020:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.35\n        ii_mid_mean: 0.72\n        ii_low_mean: 1.08\n        ii_high_median: 0.28\n        ii_mid_median: 0.55\n        ii_low_median: 0.78\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 2.1\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [-0.2, 5.8]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.058\n        problems: 50\n        phase_ordering: \"low > mid > high (correct but gradient <3×)\"\n      qwen_importance_s025:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.55\n        ii_mid_mean: 1.45\n        ii_low_mean: 3.20\n        ii_high_median: 0.42\n        ii_mid_median: 1.10\n        ii_low_median: 2.15\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 3.8\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [0.5, 8.2]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.018\n        problems: 50\n        phase_ordering: \"low > mid > high (correct, gradient marginal)\"\n      qwen_importance_s030:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.82\n        ii_mid_mean: 2.35\n        ii_low_mean: 5.50\n        ii_high_median: 0.60\n        ii_mid_median: 1.65\n        ii_low_median: 3.80\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 4.5\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [1.2, 10.5]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.009\n        problems: 50\n        phase_ordering: \"low > mid > high (correct, gradient ~5× — weaker than DeepSeek ~18×)\"\n      c5_verdict: \"not_confirmed\"\n      c5_reason: >\n        gradient <3× at s015/s020 (1.2/2.1), direction inconsistent at s015 (mid > low),\n        overall gradient 1.2-4.5 vs DeepSeek 3.8-17.8 — pattern exists at highest sparsity\n        but too weak and inconsistent for cross-model confirmation\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 使用标准 GQA（grouped-query attention）而非 DeepSeek-R1 的 MHA，\n      且未经过蒸馏训练。Qwen 的 attention pattern 更均匀——head 间的 redundancy 较低，\n      head pruning 后剩余 head 的负担增加不如 DeepSeek 剧烈。\n      因此 importance score 在 Qwen 上的判别力退化（entropy-discrimination collapse）程度较轻。\n      具体表现：(1) low-sparsity phase 的 attention 分散程度不如 DeepSeek 极端，\n      因为 Qwen 的训练没有产生 DeepSeek 那样的 \"extended thinking\" attention pattern；\n      (2) head pruning 对 Qwen attention distribution 的扰动更小，importance score 保持更多判别力；\n      (3) 综合效果是 compound severity 在 phase 间的差异很小（gradient 1-5×），\n      不足以构成 \"phase-dependent amplification\" 的证据。\n      s015 出现 mid > low 的方向反转，原因是该 sparsity 下 effect size 极小（ii 值全在 0.2-0.35 范围），\n      noise 主导了 phase 间的排序。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Qwen bf16 Importance — Interaction Index by Phase and Sparsity\"\n        columns: [sparsity, ii_high, ii_mid, ii_low, gradient, \"CI_low\", \"CI_high\", p, \"direction_correct?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.15, 0.20, 0.35, 0.22, 1.2, -0.8, 3.5, 0.15, \"No (mid>low)\"]\n          - [0.20, 0.35, 0.72, 1.08, 2.1, -0.2, 5.8, 0.058, \"Yes but <3×\"]\n          - [0.25, 0.55, 1.45, 3.20, 3.8, 0.5, 8.2, 0.018, \"Yes, marginal\"]\n          - [0.30, 0.82, 2.35, 5.50, 4.5, 1.2, 10.5, 0.009, \"Yes but weak\"]\n      - title: \"Table: Cross-Model Gradient Comparison (bf16 importance)\"\n        columns: [sparsity, \"DeepSeek gradient\", \"Qwen gradient\", \"ratio (DS/QW)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.15, 3.8, 1.2, \"3.2×\"]\n          - [0.20, 5.4, 2.1, \"2.6×\"]\n          - [0.25, 12.2, 3.8, \"3.2×\"]\n          - [0.30, 17.8, 4.5, \"4.0×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"并排 bar chart：DeepSeek vs Qwen，每个 sparsity level 的 ii_low/ii_mid/ii_high。DeepSeek 的 bars 有明显的 high→low 递增梯度，Qwen 的 bars 几乎齐平（尤其 s015/s020）。error bars 在 Qwen s015 上跨零。\"\n      - \"Scatter plot：x=DeepSeek gradient, y=Qwen gradient，4 个点 (每个 sparsity)。对角线标注 y=x。所有点远低于对角线，表明 Qwen 一致性地弱于 DeepSeek。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C5 判定 not_confirmed。Qwen 在最高 sparsity（s025/s030）展现了方向正确但幅度微弱的 phase dependence \n      （gradient 3.8-4.5），在低 sparsity（s015/s020）效应不显著且方向不一致。\n      DeepSeek-Qwen gradient 比值 2.6-4.0× 表明 phase sensitivity 的强度高度 model-dependent。\n      论文不能 claim \"finding generalizes across model families\"。\n      在 reframed 叙事下，这一失败本身成为贡献：它证明 compound sparsity 的 phase sensitivity \n      不是 universal property 而是 model-specific，进一步支持 \"benchmarking 需要 per-model phase-stratified \n      evaluation\" 的方法论贡献。Qwen 的弱结果应在 Results 中完整报告（不是 appendix），\n      作为 \"model sensitivity\" 发现的一部分。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # plan_005: Qwen random bf16 × 4 sparsity\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"Qwen random bf16 × 4 sparsity\"\n    plan_id: plan_005\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct random masking bf16 在 s=0.15/0.20/0.25/0.30，\n      作为 Qwen importance 的配对对照。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_random_s015:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.38\n        ii_mid_mean: 0.42\n        ii_low_mean: 0.40\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 1.05\n        bootstrap_p: 0.45\n      qwen_random_s020:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.75\n        ii_mid_mean: 0.82\n        ii_low_mean: 0.78\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 1.08\n        bootstrap_p: 0.40\n      qwen_random_s025:\n        ii_high_mean: 2.80\n        ii_mid_mean: 3.05\n        ii_low_mean: 2.65\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 0.98\n        bootstrap_p: 0.52\n      qwen_random_s030:\n        ii_high_mean: 15.0\n        ii_mid_mean: 14.2\n        ii_low_mean: 13.5\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 0.92\n        bootstrap_p: 0.60\n      gradient_range: [0.92, 1.08]\n      phase_flatness: \"confirmed — Qwen random equally phase-invariant as DeepSeek random\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      与 DeepSeek random 同理——random eviction 不依赖 attention weight precision 或模型架构特性，\n      compound severity 在所有 phase 均匀分布。Qwen random 的绝对 II 值略低于 DeepSeek random \n      （Qwen 的 attention 分布更均匀，random eviction 的伤害更可预测），但 phase-invariance 一致。\n      这一结果虽然在 worst tier 下不意外，但提供了一个有用的对照：\n      即使 Qwen importance 的 phase gradient 很弱（1.2-4.5），它仍然系统性地高于 random（~1.0），\n      说明 Qwen 上确实存在 importance-specific 的微弱 phase effect，只是不够强到构成 replication。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Qwen bf16 Random — Interaction Index by Phase and Sparsity\"\n        columns: [sparsity, ii_high, ii_mid, ii_low, gradient, p]\n        rows:\n          - [0.15, 0.38, 0.42, 0.40, 1.05, 0.45]\n          - [0.20, 0.75, 0.82, 0.78, 1.08, 0.40]\n          - [0.25, 2.80, 3.05, 2.65, 0.98, 0.52]\n          - [0.30, 15.0, 14.2, 13.5, 0.92, 0.60]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"与 plan_002 图合并为 2×2 panel（DeepSeek random / Qwen random × low sparsity / high sparsity），四个 panel 均显示平坦的 phase 响应。标题强调 'Random eviction: phase-invariant across models and precision'。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen random 确认了 random eviction 的 phase-invariance 是 model-agnostic 的。\n      这与 importance 的 model-specific 结果形成有意义的对比：\n      severity 的 phase-dependence 特异于 importance eviction strategy，且其强度 model-dependent。\n      在论文叙事中，random 的稳定性是 \"strategy-dependence\" 论点的基石——即使在 worst tier，\n      importance vs random 的定性差异在两个模型上都成立。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # plan_006: Attention entropy measurement\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"Attention entropy measurement (optional ablation)\"\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: >\n      测量 pruned vs unpruned 状态下的 attention entropy 和 importance score 分布，\n      直接验证 entropy-discrimination collapse 机制。P2 优先级。\n    expected_results:\n      entropy_unpruned:\n        high_phase_mean: 2.8\n        mid_phase_mean: 3.5\n        low_phase_mean: 4.2\n      entropy_pruned_30pct:\n        high_phase_mean: 3.1\n        mid_phase_mean: 4.0\n        low_phase_mean: 5.8\n      entropy_increase:\n        high_phase_delta: 0.3\n        mid_phase_delta: 0.5\n        low_phase_delta: 1.6\n        low_vs_high_ratio: 5.3\n      importance_score_discrimination:\n        gini_unpruned_high: 0.72\n        gini_unpruned_low: 0.58\n        gini_pruned_high: 0.65\n        gini_pruned_low: 0.38\n        collapse_ratio_high: 0.90  # pruned/unpruned\n        collapse_ratio_low: 0.66   # pruned/unpruned\n      correlation_entropy_vs_ii: 0.42\n      correlation_p: 0.08\n    result_rationale: >\n      Entropy-discrimination collapse 的核心预测是：head pruning → attention 重分布 → entropy 上升 → \n      importance score 判别力下降。在 worst tier 下，这个链条的方向性成立但量化关系弱：\n      (1) Entropy 确实在 pruning 后上升，尤其在 low-sparsity phase（Δ=1.6 vs high-phase Δ=0.3），\n      因为 low-phase 的 attention 原本分散在更多 head 上，pruning 后剩余 head 必须承担更多负担。\n      (2) Importance score 的判别力（Gini 系数）确实在 pruning 后下降，low-phase 下降更多 \n      （0.58→0.38 vs 0.72→0.65）。\n      (3) 但 entropy 增加与 II 之间的相关性仅 r=0.42, p=0.08——不显著。\n      这是因为 entropy-discrimination collapse 是一个间接机制：entropy 是输入，discrimination 是中介，\n      II 是输出，中间有太多 confound（不同 problem 的 token 分布、不同 phase 的 segment 长度等）\n      使得 per-problem 相关性被噪声淹没。\n      C4 维持在 partially_confirmed：方向性证据有（entropy 上升 + discrimination 下降 + phase 差异方向正确），\n      但量化因果链不完整（相关性不显著）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Attention Entropy Pre/Post Pruning by Phase\"\n        columns: [phase, \"entropy_unpruned\", \"entropy_pruned\", \"delta\", \"importance_gini_unpruned\", \"importance_gini_pruned\", \"gini_ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [high, 2.8, 3.1, 0.3, 0.72, 0.65, 0.90]\n          - [mid, 3.5, 4.0, 0.5, 0.58, 0.50, 0.86]\n          - [low, 4.2, 5.8, 1.6, 0.58, 0.38, 0.66]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双 y 轴图：左轴 = attention entropy (bars)，右轴 = importance Gini (lines)。x 轴 = phase。Unpruned vs pruned 用颜色区分。箭头标注 entropy 增加最大的 low-phase 同时 Gini 降幅也最大，暗示因果方向。但加注 'r=0.42, n.s.'。\"\n      - \"Scatter plot：x = per-problem entropy delta, y = per-problem II。点散布宽泛，回归线正斜率但 CI 宽，R²=0.18。标注 'Directionally consistent but not statistically significant'。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C4 在 worst tier 下维持 partially_confirmed。定性方向全部正确（entropy 升、discrimination 降、\n      low-phase 最严重），但缺乏统计显著的量化因果链。这在 reframed 叙事下是可接受的：\n      entropy-discrimination collapse 作为 \"testable hypothesis\" 呈现（贡献第三点），\n      而非 \"confirmed mechanism\"。论文措辞需从 \"we show that entropy-discrimination collapse explains\" \n      改为 \"we propose entropy-discrimination collapse as a candidate mechanism, supported by \n      directionally consistent evidence\"。这一降级影响有限因为 empirical finding paper 的核心价值 \n      在于现象发现（C1/C2），机制解释是锦上添花。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # plan_007: Growth rate analysis\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"Growth rate analysis from bf16 importance data\"\n    plan_id: plan_007\n    description: >\n      从 bf16 importance 4 sparsity 级别的 gradient 数据分析增长率模式，\n      验证 C6（sub-exponential growth）在 bf16 下是否成立。\n    expected_results:\n      gradients_bf16: [3.8, 5.4, 12.2, 17.8]\n      growth_rates_bf16:\n        s015_to_s020: 1.42  # 5.4/3.8\n        s020_to_s025: 2.26  # 12.2/5.4\n        s025_to_s030: 1.46  # 17.8/12.2\n      growth_rate_monotonic: false\n      growth_rate_pattern: \"1.42 → 2.26 → 1.46 (non-monotonic, middle peak)\"\n      fp32_growth_rates_for_reference: [2.24, 1.84, 1.42]\n      fp32_pattern: \"monotonically decreasing (sub-exponential confirmed)\"\n      c6_verdict: \"not_confirmed_in_bf16\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      fp32 下 growth rate 单调递减（2.24→1.84→1.42）是 sub-exponential 的标志：\n      每多 5% sparsity 带来的 gradient 增量在减小，暗示存在某种 saturation 效应。\n      bf16 下 growth rate 变为 1.42→2.26→1.46——中间出现峰值，打破单调递减。\n      原因：bf16 精度对不同 sparsity 级别的影响不均匀。s015 和 s020 的绝对 II 值小，\n      bf16 噪声对它们的相对影响更大（signal-to-noise ratio 低），导致 gradient 被压缩更多。\n      s025 的绝对 II 值开始足够大使 bf16 噪声的相对影响减小，gradient 恢复得更快。\n      结果是低 sparsity 端的 gradient 被不成比例地压缩，中间段的 growth rate 反而偏高。\n      这不是真实的 growth pattern 变化，而是 precision-dependent measurement artifact——\n      但这恰恰证明了 numerical precision 对 compound sparsity 量化的系统性影响。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Growth Rate Comparison fp32 vs bf16\"\n        columns: [\"transition\", \"fp32 gradient\", \"bf16 gradient\", \"fp32 growth rate\", \"bf16 growth rate\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015→s020\", \"11.53→11.05/27.6\", \"3.8→5.4\", 2.24, 1.42]\n          - [\"s020→s025\", \"27.6→35.72\", \"5.4→12.2\", 1.84, 2.26]\n          - [\"s025→s030\", \"35.72→41.92\", \"12.2→17.8\", 1.42, 1.46]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双线图：x = sparsity transition (015→020, 020→025, 025→030), y = growth rate。fp32 线单调下降，bf16 线呈倒 V 形。灰色注释框：'bf16 precision noise disproportionately compresses low-sparsity gradients, creating artificial non-monotonicity'。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C6 在 bf16 下不能确认——growth rate 不再单调递减，sub-exponential pattern 被 precision artifact 破坏。\n      论文有两个选择：(1) 仅用 fp32 数据支持 C6 并注明 bf16 不复现，但这暴露了 fp16/fp32/bf16 不一致的问题；\n      (2) 放弃 C6 作为独立 claim，将 sub-exponential observation 降级为 fp32 的 tentative observation。\n      在 worst tier 的 reframed 叙事下，选择 (2) 更安全：C6 本就不是核心贡献，放弃它不影响 methodology 叙事。\n      更重要的是，bf16 growth rate 的 non-monotonicity 本身可以作为 \"precision sensitivity\" 的额外证据——\n      不同 dtype 不仅改变 gradient 绝对值，还改变 gradient 的增长模式。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # plan_008: Per-problem bootstrap CI (bf16 data)\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"Per-problem bootstrap CI (bf16 data)\"\n    plan_id: plan_008\n    description: >\n      对 bf16 重跑数据（plan_001 + plan_002）重新做 B=10000 bootstrap CI，\n      验证统计显著性。\n    expected_results:\n      deepseek_importance_bf16:\n        s015:\n          gradient: 3.8\n          ci: [-0.8, 9.5]\n          p: 0.042\n          ci_crosses_zero: true\n          verdict: \"borderline significant\"\n        s020:\n          gradient: 5.4\n          ci: [1.1, 12.8]\n          p: 0.008\n          ci_crosses_zero: false\n          verdict: \"significant\"\n        s025:\n          gradient: 12.2\n          ci: [3.5, 28.0]\n          p: 0.0002\n          ci_crosses_zero: false\n          verdict: \"significant\"\n        s030:\n          gradient: 17.8\n          ci: [5.8, 48.0]\n          p: 0.0000\n          ci_crosses_zero: false\n          verdict: \"highly significant\"\n      deepseek_random_bf16:\n        s015: {gradient: 1.05, p: 0.38, verdict: \"not significant (expected)\"}\n        s020: {gradient: 1.18, p: 0.28, verdict: \"not significant (expected)\"}\n        s025: {gradient: 0.95, p: 0.42, verdict: \"not significant (expected)\"}\n        s030: {gradient: 0.72, p: 0.55, verdict: \"not significant (expected)\"}\n      importance_vs_random_test:\n        s015: {diff_gradient: 2.75, p: 0.06, verdict: \"borderline\"}\n        s020: {diff_gradient: 4.22, p: 0.012, verdict: \"significant\"}\n        s025: {diff_gradient: 11.25, p: 0.0004, verdict: \"highly significant\"}\n        s030: {diff_gradient: 17.08, p: 0.0000, verdict: \"highly significant\"}\n      bootstrap_p_max: 0.042\n      overall_assessment: >\n        3/4 sparsity levels significant for importance phase gradient;\n        s015 borderline (p=0.042, CI crosses zero);\n        importance vs random contrast significant at 3/4 levels;\n        statistical story holds but weakened at low sparsity\n    result_rationale: >\n      fp32 数据的 bootstrap 全部 p=0.0000——效应极强，bootstrap 10000 次无一反转。\n      bf16 效应被压缩后，s015 的 gradient 降至 3.8，50 个 problem 中的 per-problem paired difference \n      方差较大（一些 problem 的 low-phase 和 high-phase II 差异为负），导致 bootstrap 分布的左尾跨零。\n      p=0.042 意味着约 420/10000 次 bootstrap 采样得到 gradient ≤ 0。\n      s020+ 的效应仍然足够大使 bootstrap 收敛到 CI 不跨零。\n      Random 策略全部不显著，符合预期——random 无 phase gradient，bootstrap 正确检测到这一点。\n      Importance vs random 的对比测试在 s020+ 显著，但 s015 仅 borderline (p=0.06)。\n      整体统计框架仍然有效——bootstrap 是保守但 robust 的方法，50 problem 的样本量对 s020+ \n      级别的效应大小有足够 power，但对 s015 的弱效应 power 不足。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Bootstrap Summary — bf16 Phase Gradient\"\n        columns: [experiment, sparsity, gradient, \"CI_low\", \"CI_high\", p, \"CI crosses zero?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [DS_importance, 0.15, 3.8, -0.8, 9.5, 0.042, \"Yes\"]\n          - [DS_importance, 0.20, 5.4, 1.1, 12.8, 0.008, \"No\"]\n          - [DS_importance, 0.25, 12.2, 3.5, 28.0, 0.0002, \"No\"]\n          - [DS_importance, 0.30, 17.8, 5.8, 48.0, 0.0000, \"No\"]\n          - [DS_random, 0.15, 1.05, -0.3, 2.8, 0.38, \"Yes\"]\n          - [DS_random, 0.20, 1.18, -0.5, 3.2, 0.28, \"Yes\"]\n          - [DS_random, 0.25, 0.95, -1.2, 3.5, 0.42, \"Yes\"]\n          - [DS_random, 0.30, 0.72, -5.0, 8.5, 0.55, \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Forest plot: 每行一个实验条件 (strategy × sparsity)，点 = gradient 估计，横线 = 95% CI。垂直虚线 = 0。Importance 行的 CI 在 s020+ 远离零线，s015 跨零。Random 行全部跨零。视觉上立即区分 strategy effect。\"\n      - \"Bootstrap distribution histogram: 2×4 grid (importance/random × 4 sparsity)。Importance s015 的分布左尾明显跨零，其他三个 importance 分布完全在零右侧。Random 所有分布居中在零附近。\"\n    analysis: >\n      统计结论：bf16 importance phase gradient 在 s020/s025/s030 统计显著（p ≤ 0.008），\n      s015 borderline（p=0.042，CI [-0.8, 9.5] 跨零）。论文报告时需要特别处理 s015：\n      可以说 \"3 of 4 sparsity levels show significant phase gradient (p<0.01), \n      with the lowest sparsity level borderline (p=0.042)\"。\n      这比 fp32 的 \"all 4 levels p=0.0000\" 明显弱化，但在 methodology 叙事下可接受——\n      它恰好说明低 sparsity 下 effect 小到 precision 变化就能影响显著性，\n      强化 \"evaluation sensitivity to implementation details\" 的贡献点。\n      建议在论文中同时报告 fp32 和 bf16 的 bootstrap 结果，作为 Table 或 Figure，\n      让 reviewer 看到完整的 precision sensitivity landscape。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6905,"cache_read_input_tokens":27628,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6905},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99caed34-137a-4028-bf74-60092909c3bc","uuid":"9784f724-cfe1-408f-b2b6-946900bde32c"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":433138,"duration_api_ms":433907,"num_turns":3,"result":"Now I have all the context needed. Let me construct the detailed worst-tier predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  bf16 的低尾数精度（7-bit vs fp16 的 10-bit）大幅降低 importance score 的判别力，\n  使 importance eviction 在 bf16 下部分退化为 noisy pseudo-random。这压缩了 severity gradient 至 fp32 的 20-50%，\n  并在 s015 级别导致 CI 跨零。Qwen 未展现 monotonic phase-dependent gradient，C5 判定 not_confirmed。\n  论文需 reframe 为 methodology contribution：phase-stratified evaluation framework 暴露了 compound sparsity \n  对 eviction strategy 和 numerical precision 的隐藏敏感性。核心叙事从 \"emergent interaction\" 转为 \n  \"compound sparsity benchmarking reveals hidden sensitivity\"。贡献重构为三点：\n  (1) phase-stratified evaluation framework，(2) DeepSeek 上的 empirical phase sensitivity 发现，\n  (3) entropy-discrimination collapse 作为 testable hypothesis。\n  这类 'evaluation methodology matters' 论文在 EMNLP 有先例，不降级 venue 但需大幅改写 intro。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ================================================================\n  # plan_001: DeepSeek importance bf16 × 4 sparsity\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"DeepSeek importance bf16 × 4 sparsity\"\n    plan_id: plan_001\n    description: >\n      bf16 重跑 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B importance masking 在 s=0.15/0.20/0.25/0.30 四个 sparsity 级别。\n      消除 fp16 NaN 偏差，获得干净基线数据。\n    expected_results:\n      bf16_importance_s015:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.23\n        ii_mid_mean: 0.55\n        ii_low_mean: 2.42\n        ii_high_median: 0.17\n        ii_mid_median: 0.38\n        ii_low_median: 1.15\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 3.8\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [-0.8, 9.5]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.042\n        problems: 50\n      bf16_importance_s020:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.41\n        ii_mid_mean: 1.72\n        ii_low_mean: 8.65\n        ii_high_median: 0.30\n        ii_mid_median: 1.05\n        ii_low_median: 4.20\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 5.4\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [1.1, 12.8]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.008\n        problems: 50\n      bf16_importance_s025:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.69\n        ii_mid_mean: 3.25\n        ii_low_mean: 20.8\n        ii_high_median: 0.52\n        ii_mid_median: 2.10\n        ii_low_median: 9.80\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 12.2\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [3.5, 28.0]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.0002\n        problems: 50\n      bf16_importance_s030:\n        ii_high_mean: 1.05\n        ii_mid_mean: 8.9\n        ii_low_mean: 135.0\n        ii_high_median: 0.72\n        ii_mid_median: 4.50\n        ii_low_median: 18.5\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 17.8\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [5.8, 48.0]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.0000\n        problems: 50\n      bf16_fp32_ratios:\n        s015: 0.33\n        s020: 0.49\n        s025: 0.34\n        s030: 0.42\n      gradient_range_across_sparsity: [3.8, 17.8]\n      monotonicity_within_phase: \"preserved at s020/s025/s030; s015 borderline (ii_low CI overlaps ii_mid)\"\n      monotonicity_cross_sparsity: \"gradient increases 3.8→5.4→12.2→17.8 but growth rates non-monotonic\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      bf16 的 7-bit 尾数精度（vs fp16 的 10-bit）引入 ~0.78% 相对量化误差到 attention weight 计算中。\n      Importance score 依赖 attention weight 的精细排序来区分 \"重要\" 和 \"不重要\" 的 KV cache entry。\n      bf16 精度损失使 importance score 分布变得更平坦——即使未被 prune 的 head 上，score 的判别力已下降。\n      这等效于在 head pruning 之前就部分触发了 discrimination collapse，\n      使 importance eviction 在所有 phase 都偏向更随机的行为。\n      效果在 low-sparsity phase（attention 本就分散）最显著：原本依赖精细判别的 importance 策略\n      在 bf16 下无法充分区分 token importance，ii_low 被压缩最严重（fp32 的 8.52→bf16 的 2.42 at s015）。\n      s015 级别效应最小，bf16 噪声足以使 bootstrap CI 跨零（p=0.042，勉强显著）。\n      高 sparsity 级别（s025/s030）效应依然显著但幅度大幅衰减——gradient 从 fp32 的 35-42 降至 12-18，\n      衰减比 0.34-0.42。这不是 NaN 导致的 artifact，而是精度本身影响了 importance eviction 的有效性。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: DeepSeek bf16 Importance — Interaction Index by Phase and Sparsity\"\n        columns: [sparsity, ii_high, ii_mid, ii_low, gradient, \"CI_low\", \"CI_high\", p, \"bf16/fp32 ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.15, 0.23, 0.55, 2.42, 3.8, -0.8, 9.5, 0.042, 0.33]\n          - [0.20, 0.41, 1.72, 8.65, 5.4, 1.1, 12.8, 0.008, 0.49]\n          - [0.25, 0.69, 3.25, 20.8, 12.2, 3.5, 28.0, 0.0002, 0.34]\n          - [0.30, 1.05, 8.9, 135.0, 17.8, 5.8, 48.0, 0.0000, 0.42]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: 4×3 grid (sparsity × phase), color = ii_mean。与 fp32 版本并排对比，色标统一。bf16 色彩明显更淡，尤其 low-phase 行被压缩。s015 low-phase 格标注 'n.s.' (CI crosses zero)。\"\n      - \"Line plot: gradient vs sparsity for bf16 vs fp32。两条线，fp32 线陡峭（11→42），bf16 线平缓（3.8→17.8）。灰色带标注 bf16/fp32 ratio 范围 [0.33, 0.49]。\"\n    analysis: >\n      bf16 结果确认 importance eviction 的 phase sensitivity 在方向上仍然存在（high < mid < low ordering 在 s020+ 成立），\n      但幅度被压缩至 fp32 的 33-49%。s015 CI 跨零意味着最低 sparsity 级别的 phase effect 在 bf16 下不再统计显著。\n      这对论文有双重含义：(1) 削弱了 effect size 的 claim（不能说 \"12-75×\"，bf16 下是 \"3.8-17.8×\"）；\n      (2) 但同时提供了新贡献角度——numerical precision 本身是 compound sparsity severity 的隐藏调节因子，\n      这强化了 \"evaluation methodology matters\" 的叙事。论文需报告 fp32 和 bf16 双版本数据，\n      将 precision sensitivity 作为第二个发现维度（strategy × phase × precision 三维交互）。\n      s015 的不显著结果需要在 limitation 中明确讨论。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # plan_002: DeepSeek random bf16 × 4 sparsity\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"DeepSeek random bf16 × 4 sparsity\"\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: >\n      bf16 重跑 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B random masking 在 s=0.15/0.20/0.25/0.30，\n      作为 importance 的配对对照。验证 random eviction 在 bf16 下仍然 phase-invariant。\n    expected_results:\n      bf16_random_s015:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.42\n        ii_mid_mean: 0.48\n        ii_low_mean: 0.45\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 1.05\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [-0.3, 2.8]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.38\n        problems: 50\n      bf16_random_s020:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.80\n        ii_mid_mean: 1.15\n        ii_low_mean: 0.92\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 1.18\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [-0.5, 3.2]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.28\n        problems: 50\n      bf16_random_s025:\n        ii_high_mean: 3.50\n        ii_mid_mean: 3.80\n        ii_low_mean: 3.15\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 0.95\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [-1.2, 3.5]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.42\n        problems: 50\n      bf16_random_s030:\n        ii_high_mean: 19.5\n        ii_mid_mean: 13.2\n        ii_low_mean: 12.8\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 0.72\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [-5.0, 8.5]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.55\n        problems: 50\n      gradient_range_across_sparsity: [0.72, 1.18]\n      phase_flatness: \"all gradients ≈1.0, no significant phase dependence\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Random eviction 不依赖 attention weight 的精度——它随机选择 token 进行 evict，\n      因此 bf16 的精度损失不影响 eviction 决策。compound interaction（head pruning × KV eviction）\n      在 random 策略下的 severity 在所有 phase 保持均匀，因为 random 不受 attention distribution \n      变化的影响。无论 attention 是集中还是分散（high vs low sparsity phase），\n      random 都以相同概率 evict 任意 token，产出一致的 compound degradation。\n      bf16 精度仅影响 perplexity 计算本身的微小数值差异，不改变 random eviction 的 phase-invariant 特性。\n      gradient 维持在 0.7-1.2 范围内，所有 p-value 远不显著，确认 phase flatness。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: DeepSeek bf16 Random — Interaction Index by Phase and Sparsity\"\n        columns: [sparsity, ii_high, ii_mid, ii_low, gradient, p]\n        rows:\n          - [0.15, 0.42, 0.48, 0.45, 1.05, 0.38]\n          - [0.20, 0.80, 1.15, 0.92, 1.18, 0.28]\n          - [0.25, 3.50, 3.80, 3.15, 0.95, 0.42]\n          - [0.30, 19.5, 13.2, 12.8, 0.72, 0.55]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: ii_mean by phase (high/mid/low) for each sparsity level，四条近乎水平的线。与 importance 的陡峭上升形成鲜明对比。即使在 worst tier，importance-random 的定性区别仍然清晰。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Random bf16 结果与 fp32 高度一致（gradient 变化 <0.2），确认 random eviction 的 phase-invariant \n      特性不受 numerical precision 影响。这是 worst tier 中的亮点——C1（strategy-dependence）仍然成立：\n      即使 bf16 压缩了 importance 的 gradient 到 3.8-17.8，random 的 gradient 稳定在 ~1.0。\n      Strategy-dependence 的定性结论（importance >> random in severity gradient）在 bf16 下保持，\n      只是量化幅度减小。这支持 reframe 后的贡献 (2)：precision sensitivity 本身是有意义的发现。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # plan_003: Crossover analysis\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"Crossover analysis from bf16 importance + random\"\n    plan_id: plan_003\n    description: >\n      从 plan_001 和 plan_002 的 bf16 数据中提取 per-phase II，验证 phase-strategy crossover \n      是否在 bf16 下仍存在。纯分析任务。\n    expected_results:\n      deepseek_crossover_s025:\n        importance_high_phase: 0.69\n        importance_low_phase: 20.8\n        random_high_phase: 3.50\n        random_low_phase: 3.15\n        crossover_exists: true\n        crossover_gap_high: -2.81  # importance(0.69) - random(3.50)\n        crossover_gap_low: 17.65   # importance(20.8) - random(3.15)\n        crossover_significance_p: 0.003\n      deepseek_crossover_s030:\n        importance_high_phase: 1.05\n        importance_low_phase: 135.0\n        random_high_phase: 19.5\n        random_low_phase: 12.8\n        crossover_exists: true\n        crossover_gap_high: -18.45\n        crossover_gap_low: 122.2\n      deepseek_crossover_s020:\n        importance_high_phase: 0.41\n        importance_low_phase: 8.65\n        random_high_phase: 0.80\n        random_low_phase: 0.92\n        crossover_exists: true\n        crossover_gap_high: -0.39\n        crossover_gap_low: 7.73\n        note: \"crossover exists but high-phase gap very small (0.39), borderline\"\n      deepseek_crossover_s015:\n        importance_high_phase: 0.23\n        importance_low_phase: 2.42\n        random_high_phase: 0.42\n        random_low_phase: 0.45\n        crossover_exists: true\n        crossover_gap_high: -0.19\n        crossover_gap_low: 1.97\n        note: \"both gaps small and importance_low CI crosses zero, crossover not robust\"\n      qwen_crossover_s025:\n        importance_high_phase: 0.48\n        importance_low_phase: 3.20\n        random_high_phase: 2.80\n        random_low_phase: 2.65\n        crossover_exists: \"marginal\"\n        crossover_gap_low: 0.55\n        note: \"importance_low(3.20) barely > random_low(2.65), CI overlaps → not significant\"\n      crossover_confirmed_models: 1\n      crossover_model_list: [\"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\"]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Crossover 要求在 high-sparsity phase 中 importance < random，而在 low-sparsity phase 中 importance > random。\n      DeepSeek bf16 下这一 pattern 在 s025/s030 仍清晰（importance_low 分别为 20.8 和 135.0，远超 random 的 3.15 和 12.8），\n      但在 s015/s020 crossover 的 gap 很小且依赖 CI 不跨零。\n      Qwen 的情况更糟：importance gradient 仅 1-5×，使得 importance_low 在最高 sparsity（s025）也只有 3.20，\n      勉强超过 random 的 2.65。Bootstrap CI 宽泛到包含零差——crossover 在 Qwen 上不成立。\n      因此 crossover 仅在 DeepSeek 单模型确认（crossover_confirmed_models=1），\n      reviewer 可合理质疑这是 model-specific artifact（DeepSeek-R1 的蒸馏训练方式可能导致特殊的 attention pattern）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Phase-Strategy Crossover Summary (bf16)\"\n        columns: [model, sparsity, \"imp_high\", \"imp_low\", \"rand_high\", \"rand_low\", \"crossover?\", \"gap_significance\"]\n        rows:\n          - [DeepSeek, 0.25, 0.69, 20.8, 3.50, 3.15, \"Yes\", \"p=0.003\"]\n          - [DeepSeek, 0.30, 1.05, 135.0, 19.5, 12.8, \"Yes\", \"p<0.001\"]\n          - [DeepSeek, 0.20, 0.41, 8.65, 0.80, 0.92, \"Yes*\", \"borderline\"]\n          - [DeepSeek, 0.15, 0.23, 2.42, 0.42, 0.45, \"Yes*\", \"n.s. (imp_low CI∋0)\"]\n          - [Qwen, 0.25, 0.48, 3.20, 2.80, 2.65, \"No\", \"gap=0.55, CI∋0\"]\n          - [Qwen, 0.30, 0.65, 5.50, 15.0, 14.2, \"No\", \"imp_low < rand_low\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Crossover diagram: 2×2 panel (DeepSeek × Qwen)。每个 panel 画 importance 和 random 的 high/low phase II 作为 bar pair。DeepSeek panel 显示清晰的 X 形交叉（importance bars 从 low→high 急剧下降，random bars 平坦）。Qwen panel 无交叉——importance bars 微弱上升但始终不超过 random。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Crossover 现象在 bf16 DeepSeek 上依然存在但仅在 s025/s030 robust。s015/s020 的 crossover \n      gap 过小且统计不显著。Qwen 完全未展现 crossover。这意味着 C3 只能声明为 \"observed in \n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B at higher sparsity levels\"，而非 general phenomenon。\n      在 reframed 的 methodology 叙事下，crossover 从 \"核心发现\" 降级为 \"DeepSeek 上的有趣观察\"，\n      作为 phase-stratified evaluation 揭示 hidden sensitivity 的一个案例。\n      Reviewer 将合理质疑 crossover 是 DeepSeek-R1 蒸馏训练导致的特殊 attention pattern 的副产品。\n      应对策略：在 discussion 中明确承认这一限制，并将 crossover 的 model-specificity \n      本身作为 \"compound sparsity 行为比预期更 model-dependent\" 的证据。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # plan_004: Qwen importance bf16 × 4 sparsity\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"Qwen importance bf16 × 4 sparsity\"\n    plan_id: plan_004\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct importance masking bf16 在 s=0.15/0.20/0.25/0.30。\n      Cross-model replication 核心实验。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_importance_s015:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.20\n        ii_mid_mean: 0.35\n        ii_low_mean: 0.22\n        ii_high_median: 0.15\n        ii_mid_median: 0.28\n        ii_low_median: 0.18\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 1.2\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [-0.8, 3.5]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.15\n        problems: 50\n        phase_ordering: \"mid > low > high (NOT monotonic)\"\n      qwen_importance_s020:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.35\n        ii_mid_mean: 0.72\n        ii_low_mean: 1.08\n        ii_high_median: 0.28\n        ii_mid_median: 0.55\n        ii_low_median: 0.78\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 2.1\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [-0.2, 5.8]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.058\n        problems: 50\n        phase_ordering: \"low > mid > high (correct but gradient <3×)\"\n      qwen_importance_s025:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.55\n        ii_mid_mean: 1.45\n        ii_low_mean: 3.20\n        ii_high_median: 0.42\n        ii_mid_median: 1.10\n        ii_low_median: 2.15\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 3.8\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [0.5, 8.2]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.018\n        problems: 50\n        phase_ordering: \"low > mid > high (correct, gradient marginal)\"\n      qwen_importance_s030:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.82\n        ii_mid_mean: 2.35\n        ii_low_mean: 5.50\n        ii_high_median: 0.60\n        ii_mid_median: 1.65\n        ii_low_median: 3.80\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 4.5\n        bootstrap_ci_paired: [1.2, 10.5]\n        bootstrap_p: 0.009\n        problems: 50\n        phase_ordering: \"low > mid > high (correct, gradient ~5× — weaker than DeepSeek ~18×)\"\n      c5_verdict: \"not_confirmed\"\n      c5_reason: >\n        gradient <3× at s015/s020 (1.2/2.1), direction inconsistent at s015 (mid > low),\n        overall gradient 1.2-4.5 vs DeepSeek 3.8-17.8 — pattern exists at highest sparsity\n        but too weak and inconsistent for cross-model confirmation\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 使用标准 GQA（grouped-query attention）而非 DeepSeek-R1 的 MHA，\n      且未经过蒸馏训练。Qwen 的 attention pattern 更均匀——head 间的 redundancy 较低，\n      head pruning 后剩余 head 的负担增加不如 DeepSeek 剧烈。\n      因此 importance score 在 Qwen 上的判别力退化（entropy-discrimination collapse）程度较轻。\n      具体表现：(1) low-sparsity phase 的 attention 分散程度不如 DeepSeek 极端，\n      因为 Qwen 的训练没有产生 DeepSeek 那样的 \"extended thinking\" attention pattern；\n      (2) head pruning 对 Qwen attention distribution 的扰动更小，importance score 保持更多判别力；\n      (3) 综合效果是 compound severity 在 phase 间的差异很小（gradient 1-5×），\n      不足以构成 \"phase-dependent amplification\" 的证据。\n      s015 出现 mid > low 的方向反转，原因是该 sparsity 下 effect size 极小（ii 值全在 0.2-0.35 范围），\n      noise 主导了 phase 间的排序。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Qwen bf16 Importance — Interaction Index by Phase and Sparsity\"\n        columns: [sparsity, ii_high, ii_mid, ii_low, gradient, \"CI_low\", \"CI_high\", p, \"direction_correct?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.15, 0.20, 0.35, 0.22, 1.2, -0.8, 3.5, 0.15, \"No (mid>low)\"]\n          - [0.20, 0.35, 0.72, 1.08, 2.1, -0.2, 5.8, 0.058, \"Yes but <3×\"]\n          - [0.25, 0.55, 1.45, 3.20, 3.8, 0.5, 8.2, 0.018, \"Yes, marginal\"]\n          - [0.30, 0.82, 2.35, 5.50, 4.5, 1.2, 10.5, 0.009, \"Yes but weak\"]\n      - title: \"Table: Cross-Model Gradient Comparison (bf16 importance)\"\n        columns: [sparsity, \"DeepSeek gradient\", \"Qwen gradient\", \"ratio (DS/QW)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.15, 3.8, 1.2, \"3.2×\"]\n          - [0.20, 5.4, 2.1, \"2.6×\"]\n          - [0.25, 12.2, 3.8, \"3.2×\"]\n          - [0.30, 17.8, 4.5, \"4.0×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"并排 bar chart：DeepSeek vs Qwen，每个 sparsity level 的 ii_low/ii_mid/ii_high。DeepSeek 的 bars 有明显的 high→low 递增梯度，Qwen 的 bars 几乎齐平（尤其 s015/s020）。error bars 在 Qwen s015 上跨零。\"\n      - \"Scatter plot：x=DeepSeek gradient, y=Qwen gradient，4 个点 (每个 sparsity)。对角线标注 y=x。所有点远低于对角线，表明 Qwen 一致性地弱于 DeepSeek。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C5 判定 not_confirmed。Qwen 在最高 sparsity（s025/s030）展现了方向正确但幅度微弱的 phase dependence \n      （gradient 3.8-4.5），在低 sparsity（s015/s020）效应不显著且方向不一致。\n      DeepSeek-Qwen gradient 比值 2.6-4.0× 表明 phase sensitivity 的强度高度 model-dependent。\n      论文不能 claim \"finding generalizes across model families\"。\n      在 reframed 叙事下，这一失败本身成为贡献：它证明 compound sparsity 的 phase sensitivity \n      不是 universal property 而是 model-specific，进一步支持 \"benchmarking 需要 per-model phase-stratified \n      evaluation\" 的方法论贡献。Qwen 的弱结果应在 Results 中完整报告（不是 appendix），\n      作为 \"model sensitivity\" 发现的一部分。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # plan_005: Qwen random bf16 × 4 sparsity\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"Qwen random bf16 × 4 sparsity\"\n    plan_id: plan_005\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct random masking bf16 在 s=0.15/0.20/0.25/0.30，\n      作为 Qwen importance 的配对对照。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_random_s015:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.38\n        ii_mid_mean: 0.42\n        ii_low_mean: 0.40\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 1.05\n        bootstrap_p: 0.45\n      qwen_random_s020:\n        ii_high_mean: 0.75\n        ii_mid_mean: 0.82\n        ii_low_mean: 0.78\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 1.08\n        bootstrap_p: 0.40\n      qwen_random_s025:\n        ii_high_mean: 2.80\n        ii_mid_mean: 3.05\n        ii_low_mean: 2.65\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 0.98\n        bootstrap_p: 0.52\n      qwen_random_s030:\n        ii_high_mean: 15.0\n        ii_mid_mean: 14.2\n        ii_low_mean: 13.5\n        bootstrap_gradient_paired: 0.92\n        bootstrap_p: 0.60\n      gradient_range: [0.92, 1.08]\n      phase_flatness: \"confirmed — Qwen random equally phase-invariant as DeepSeek random\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      与 DeepSeek random 同理——random eviction 不依赖 attention weight precision 或模型架构特性，\n      compound severity 在所有 phase 均匀分布。Qwen random 的绝对 II 值略低于 DeepSeek random \n      （Qwen 的 attention 分布更均匀，random eviction 的伤害更可预测），但 phase-invariance 一致。\n      这一结果虽然在 worst tier 下不意外，但提供了一个有用的对照：\n      即使 Qwen importance 的 phase gradient 很弱（1.2-4.5），它仍然系统性地高于 random（~1.0），\n      说明 Qwen 上确实存在 importance-specific 的微弱 phase effect，只是不够强到构成 replication。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Qwen bf16 Random — Interaction Index by Phase and Sparsity\"\n        columns: [sparsity, ii_high, ii_mid, ii_low, gradient, p]\n        rows:\n          - [0.15, 0.38, 0.42, 0.40, 1.05, 0.45]\n          - [0.20, 0.75, 0.82, 0.78, 1.08, 0.40]\n          - [0.25, 2.80, 3.05, 2.65, 0.98, 0.52]\n          - [0.30, 15.0, 14.2, 13.5, 0.92, 0.60]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"与 plan_002 图合并为 2×2 panel（DeepSeek random / Qwen random × low sparsity / high sparsity），四个 panel 均显示平坦的 phase 响应。标题强调 'Random eviction: phase-invariant across models and precision'。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen random 确认了 random eviction 的 phase-invariance 是 model-agnostic 的。\n      这与 importance 的 model-specific 结果形成有意义的对比：\n      severity 的 phase-dependence 特异于 importance eviction strategy，且其强度 model-dependent。\n      在论文叙事中，random 的稳定性是 \"strategy-dependence\" 论点的基石——即使在 worst tier，\n      importance vs random 的定性差异在两个模型上都成立。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # plan_006: Attention entropy measurement\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"Attention entropy measurement (optional ablation)\"\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: >\n      测量 pruned vs unpruned 状态下的 attention entropy 和 importance score 分布，\n      直接验证 entropy-discrimination collapse 机制。P2 优先级。\n    expected_results:\n      entropy_unpruned:\n        high_phase_mean: 2.8\n        mid_phase_mean: 3.5\n        low_phase_mean: 4.2\n      entropy_pruned_30pct:\n        high_phase_mean: 3.1\n        mid_phase_mean: 4.0\n        low_phase_mean: 5.8\n      entropy_increase:\n        high_phase_delta: 0.3\n        mid_phase_delta: 0.5\n        low_phase_delta: 1.6\n        low_vs_high_ratio: 5.3\n      importance_score_discrimination:\n        gini_unpruned_high: 0.72\n        gini_unpruned_low: 0.58\n        gini_pruned_high: 0.65\n        gini_pruned_low: 0.38\n        collapse_ratio_high: 0.90  # pruned/unpruned\n        collapse_ratio_low: 0.66   # pruned/unpruned\n      correlation_entropy_vs_ii: 0.42\n      correlation_p: 0.08\n    result_rationale: >\n      Entropy-discrimination collapse 的核心预测是：head pruning → attention 重分布 → entropy 上升 → \n      importance score 判别力下降。在 worst tier 下，这个链条的方向性成立但量化关系弱：\n      (1) Entropy 确实在 pruning 后上升，尤其在 low-sparsity phase（Δ=1.6 vs high-phase Δ=0.3），\n      因为 low-phase 的 attention 原本分散在更多 head 上，pruning 后剩余 head 必须承担更多负担。\n      (2) Importance score 的判别力（Gini 系数）确实在 pruning 后下降，low-phase 下降更多 \n      （0.58→0.38 vs 0.72→0.65）。\n      (3) 但 entropy 增加与 II 之间的相关性仅 r=0.42, p=0.08——不显著。\n      这是因为 entropy-discrimination collapse 是一个间接机制：entropy 是输入，discrimination 是中介，\n      II 是输出，中间有太多 confound（不同 problem 的 token 分布、不同 phase 的 segment 长度等）\n      使得 per-problem 相关性被噪声淹没。\n      C4 维持在 partially_confirmed：方向性证据有（entropy 上升 + discrimination 下降 + phase 差异方向正确），\n      但量化因果链不完整（相关性不显著）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Attention Entropy Pre/Post Pruning by Phase\"\n        columns: [phase, \"entropy_unpruned\", \"entropy_pruned\", \"delta\", \"importance_gini_unpruned\", \"importance_gini_pruned\", \"gini_ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [high, 2.8, 3.1, 0.3, 0.72, 0.65, 0.90]\n          - [mid, 3.5, 4.0, 0.5, 0.58, 0.50, 0.86]\n          - [low, 4.2, 5.8, 1.6, 0.58, 0.38, 0.66]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双 y 轴图：左轴 = attention entropy (bars)，右轴 = importance Gini (lines)。x 轴 = phase。Unpruned vs pruned 用颜色区分。箭头标注 entropy 增加最大的 low-phase 同时 Gini 降幅也最大，暗示因果方向。但加注 'r=0.42, n.s.'。\"\n      - \"Scatter plot：x = per-problem entropy delta, y = per-problem II。点散布宽泛，回归线正斜率但 CI 宽，R²=0.18。标注 'Directionally consistent but not statistically significant'。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C4 在 worst tier 下维持 partially_confirmed。定性方向全部正确（entropy 升、discrimination 降、\n      low-phase 最严重），但缺乏统计显著的量化因果链。这在 reframed 叙事下是可接受的：\n      entropy-discrimination collapse 作为 \"testable hypothesis\" 呈现（贡献第三点），\n      而非 \"confirmed mechanism\"。论文措辞需从 \"we show that entropy-discrimination collapse explains\" \n      改为 \"we propose entropy-discrimination collapse as a candidate mechanism, supported by \n      directionally consistent evidence\"。这一降级影响有限因为 empirical finding paper 的核心价值 \n      在于现象发现（C1/C2），机制解释是锦上添花。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # plan_007: Growth rate analysis\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"Growth rate analysis from bf16 importance data\"\n    plan_id: plan_007\n    description: >\n      从 bf16 importance 4 sparsity 级别的 gradient 数据分析增长率模式，\n      验证 C6（sub-exponential growth）在 bf16 下是否成立。\n    expected_results:\n      gradients_bf16: [3.8, 5.4, 12.2, 17.8]\n      growth_rates_bf16:\n        s015_to_s020: 1.42  # 5.4/3.8\n        s020_to_s025: 2.26  # 12.2/5.4\n        s025_to_s030: 1.46  # 17.8/12.2\n      growth_rate_monotonic: false\n      growth_rate_pattern: \"1.42 → 2.26 → 1.46 (non-monotonic, middle peak)\"\n      fp32_growth_rates_for_reference: [2.24, 1.84, 1.42]\n      fp32_pattern: \"monotonically decreasing (sub-exponential confirmed)\"\n      c6_verdict: \"not_confirmed_in_bf16\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      fp32 下 growth rate 单调递减（2.24→1.84→1.42）是 sub-exponential 的标志：\n      每多 5% sparsity 带来的 gradient 增量在减小，暗示存在某种 saturation 效应。\n      bf16 下 growth rate 变为 1.42→2.26→1.46——中间出现峰值，打破单调递减。\n      原因：bf16 精度对不同 sparsity 级别的影响不均匀。s015 和 s020 的绝对 II 值小，\n      bf16 噪声对它们的相对影响更大（signal-to-noise ratio 低），导致 gradient 被压缩更多。\n      s025 的绝对 II 值开始足够大使 bf16 噪声的相对影响减小，gradient 恢复得更快。\n      结果是低 sparsity 端的 gradient 被不成比例地压缩，中间段的 growth rate 反而偏高。\n      这不是真实的 growth pattern 变化，而是 precision-dependent measurement artifact——\n      但这恰恰证明了 numerical precision 对 compound sparsity 量化的系统性影响。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Growth Rate Comparison fp32 vs bf16\"\n        columns: [\"transition\", \"fp32 gradient\", \"bf16 gradient\", \"fp32 growth rate\", \"bf16 growth rate\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015→s020\", \"11.53→11.05/27.6\", \"3.8→5.4\", 2.24, 1.42]\n          - [\"s020→s025\", \"27.6→35.72\", \"5.4→12.2\", 1.84, 2.26]\n          - [\"s025→s030\", \"35.72→41.92\", \"12.2→17.8\", 1.42, 1.46]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双线图：x = sparsity transition (015→020, 020→025, 025→030), y = growth rate。fp32 线单调下降，bf16 线呈倒 V 形。灰色注释框：'bf16 precision noise disproportionately compresses low-sparsity gradients, creating artificial non-monotonicity'。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C6 在 bf16 下不能确认——growth rate 不再单调递减，sub-exponential pattern 被 precision artifact 破坏。\n      论文有两个选择：(1) 仅用 fp32 数据支持 C6 并注明 bf16 不复现，但这暴露了 fp16/fp32/bf16 不一致的问题；\n      (2) 放弃 C6 作为独立 claim，将 sub-exponential observation 降级为 fp32 的 tentative observation。\n      在 worst tier 的 reframed 叙事下，选择 (2) 更安全：C6 本就不是核心贡献，放弃它不影响 methodology 叙事。\n      更重要的是，bf16 growth rate 的 non-monotonicity 本身可以作为 \"precision sensitivity\" 的额外证据——\n      不同 dtype 不仅改变 gradient 绝对值，还改变 gradient 的增长模式。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # plan_008: Per-problem bootstrap CI (bf16 data)\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"Per-problem bootstrap CI (bf16 data)\"\n    plan_id: plan_008\n    description: >\n      对 bf16 重跑数据（plan_001 + plan_002）重新做 B=10000 bootstrap CI，\n      验证统计显著性。\n    expected_results:\n      deepseek_importance_bf16:\n        s015:\n          gradient: 3.8\n          ci: [-0.8, 9.5]\n          p: 0.042\n          ci_crosses_zero: true\n          verdict: \"borderline significant\"\n        s020:\n          gradient: 5.4\n          ci: [1.1, 12.8]\n          p: 0.008\n          ci_crosses_zero: false\n          verdict: \"significant\"\n        s025:\n          gradient: 12.2\n          ci: [3.5, 28.0]\n          p: 0.0002\n          ci_crosses_zero: false\n          verdict: \"significant\"\n        s030:\n          gradient: 17.8\n          ci: [5.8, 48.0]\n          p: 0.0000\n          ci_crosses_zero: false\n          verdict: \"highly significant\"\n      deepseek_random_bf16:\n        s015: {gradient: 1.05, p: 0.38, verdict: \"not significant (expected)\"}\n        s020: {gradient: 1.18, p: 0.28, verdict: \"not significant (expected)\"}\n        s025: {gradient: 0.95, p: 0.42, verdict: \"not significant (expected)\"}\n        s030: {gradient: 0.72, p: 0.55, verdict: \"not significant (expected)\"}\n      importance_vs_random_test:\n        s015: {diff_gradient: 2.75, p: 0.06, verdict: \"borderline\"}\n        s020: {diff_gradient: 4.22, p: 0.012, verdict: \"significant\"}\n        s025: {diff_gradient: 11.25, p: 0.0004, verdict: \"highly significant\"}\n        s030: {diff_gradient: 17.08, p: 0.0000, verdict: \"highly significant\"}\n      bootstrap_p_max: 0.042\n      overall_assessment: >\n        3/4 sparsity levels significant for importance phase gradient;\n        s015 borderline (p=0.042, CI crosses zero);\n        importance vs random contrast significant at 3/4 levels;\n        statistical story holds but weakened at low sparsity\n    result_rationale: >\n      fp32 数据的 bootstrap 全部 p=0.0000——效应极强，bootstrap 10000 次无一反转。\n      bf16 效应被压缩后，s015 的 gradient 降至 3.8，50 个 problem 中的 per-problem paired difference \n      方差较大（一些 problem 的 low-phase 和 high-phase II 差异为负），导致 bootstrap 分布的左尾跨零。\n      p=0.042 意味着约 420/10000 次 bootstrap 采样得到 gradient ≤ 0。\n      s020+ 的效应仍然足够大使 bootstrap 收敛到 CI 不跨零。\n      Random 策略全部不显著，符合预期——random 无 phase gradient，bootstrap 正确检测到这一点。\n      Importance vs random 的对比测试在 s020+ 显著，但 s015 仅 borderline (p=0.06)。\n      整体统计框架仍然有效——bootstrap 是保守但 robust 的方法，50 problem 的样本量对 s020+ \n      级别的效应大小有足够 power，但对 s015 的弱效应 power 不足。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Bootstrap Summary — bf16 Phase Gradient\"\n        columns: [experiment, sparsity, gradient, \"CI_low\", \"CI_high\", p, \"CI crosses zero?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [DS_importance, 0.15, 3.8, -0.8, 9.5, 0.042, \"Yes\"]\n          - [DS_importance, 0.20, 5.4, 1.1, 12.8, 0.008, \"No\"]\n          - [DS_importance, 0.25, 12.2, 3.5, 28.0, 0.0002, \"No\"]\n          - [DS_importance, 0.30, 17.8, 5.8, 48.0, 0.0000, \"No\"]\n          - [DS_random, 0.15, 1.05, -0.3, 2.8, 0.38, \"Yes\"]\n          - [DS_random, 0.20, 1.18, -0.5, 3.2, 0.28, \"Yes\"]\n          - [DS_random, 0.25, 0.95, -1.2, 3.5, 0.42, \"Yes\"]\n          - [DS_random, 0.30, 0.72, -5.0, 8.5, 0.55, \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Forest plot: 每行一个实验条件 (strategy × sparsity)，点 = gradient 估计，横线 = 95% CI。垂直虚线 = 0。Importance 行的 CI 在 s020+ 远离零线，s015 跨零。Random 行全部跨零。视觉上立即区分 strategy effect。\"\n      - \"Bootstrap distribution histogram: 2×4 grid (importance/random × 4 sparsity)。Importance s015 的分布左尾明显跨零，其他三个 importance 分布完全在零右侧。Random 所有分布居中在零附近。\"\n    analysis: >\n      统计结论：bf16 importance phase gradient 在 s020/s025/s030 统计显著（p ≤ 0.008），\n      s015 borderline（p=0.042，CI [-0.8, 9.5] 跨零）。论文报告时需要特别处理 s015：\n      可以说 \"3 of 4 sparsity levels show significant phase gradient (p<0.01), \n      with the lowest sparsity level borderline (p=0.042)\"。\n      这比 fp32 的 \"all 4 levels p=0.0000\" 明显弱化，但在 methodology 叙事下可接受——\n      它恰好说明低 sparsity 下 effect 小到 precision 变化就能影响显著性，\n      强化 \"evaluation sensitivity to implementation details\" 的贡献点。\n      建议在论文中同时报告 fp32 和 bf16 的 bootstrap 结果，作为 Table 或 Figure，\n      让 reviewer 看到完整的 precision sensitivity landscape。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"99caed34-137a-4028-bf74-60092909c3bc","total_cost_usd":0.8236001000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22692,"cache_read_input_tokens":66225,"output_tokens":22847,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22692,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":22551,"cache_read_input_tokens":27628,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6905,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6905},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":9893,"outputTokens":1220,"cacheReadInputTokens":39496,"cacheCreationInputTokens":46020,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0774676,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":22847,"cacheReadInputTokens":66225,"cacheCreationInputTokens":22692,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.7461325000000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"d232dd49-b580-4457-92c3-4d0eb8483f30"}
